@startuml command_general

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classFontStyle bold
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam ClassBorderColor #444444
skinparam PackageBackgroundColor #f9f9f9

package "Client code" {
  class Client
}

package "Command" {
  abstract class Command {
    + execute() : None  {abstract}
    + undo()    : None  {abstract}
  }

  class ConcreteCommand {
    - _receiver : Receiver
    + execute() : None
    + undo()    : None
  }

  Command <|-- ConcreteCommand
}

package "Invoker" {
  class Invoker {
    - _history : list[Command]
    + run(command: Command) : None
    + undo() : None
  }
}

package "Receiver" {
  class Receiver {
    + action() : None
    + reverse_action() : None
  }
}

Client      --> Invoker         : submits commands
Client      --> ConcreteCommand : creates
ConcreteCommand o--> Receiver   : calls action on
Invoker     *--  Command        : stores history

note right of Invoker
  Executes commands and
  keeps history for undo.
end note

note right of Command
  Encapsulates a request
  as an object.
end note

note right of Receiver
  Knows how to perform
  the actual work.
end note

legend right
  <|--  inheritance
  *--   composition (owns)
  o-->  aggregation (references)
  -->   association
end legend

@enduml
